<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-10T01:41:02.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Haiti's prime minister announced that police killed gang leader Mathias Saintil and that police and Salvadoran troops destroyed the house of a 400 Mawozo gang leader. Salvadoran President Bukele is sending troops to Haiti and the Haitian leader is traveling to El Salvador to discuss the offensive. A Haitian education official and two others were freed after nearly two months in gang captivity. Amnesty International warned that the deployment of Salvadoran forces must respect human rights. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPSG83cVJ2TDltT2JOYkVrMFAtbDFsNjV5bUJBN3YtU0JyWkNQaGNBTVdyU0JxblEzZ1B1TVNqT3V1MmJDeWw2WWxtSGFvSGNCcl9xU01adUdaZzRkeEJjNWhxUHRMeXByMmJhOWNUX25HUGl3ampua2kzSmNXUHh3dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPaXlJMTRTeE9vYmg3QTl3ZEpFWnREbkVMaTkya085ZDROY3B2eE1xRHVvUlRST3FmY2dsYUN2RHllZHQ0NTRhdmlGTVpvZGlZdjhyR3JoSE9MeWRid0o4TUs0ZE5XQUFRSnprdFNjbkNURnRqWXROQ2Z3R1ppeWYxNk1sSnJwWXRQX0dBNnVSSWNOMFdwUWhnY0xqbEpvYlIwMkl0a1lB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOUkdOZEEtMTQ5NzlLdWRCRUlzdVFsWkFoR0xPOTdIV2szN1hTWmNLQTBHejRjVUI0YTU1bDJpUXdONl9VSlQtZU9iLVRTWFhEbi1RLTZuNEJGQTFxZ1JXWVBBRk43Rjl0VXJrTnF5MXNONkM2TFRYRUM3QXVqTVBOR0R0a1o4NkNsZDhUVVNYTzRkTWNvYm4yRFpEWmVfUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE5IMWwyWTQ2WWdZQjVYU0liWjAwYi0zS2tSUDZFd01DTUhXVnBrc3dxYWV0Q3cweVRFWkJyUjNLLW1UcjNsdG11akNKM3BXYl9nSzFIem5WeVZQcGV2MjRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Colom